Description: VeltOS Media Player, a Windows 11 style music and video player
 The layout of Windows 11's Media Player: Home with recent media, the
 music library (songs, albums, artists, shuffle and play) and the video
 library from the Music and Videos folders, the play queue, playlists,
 search, the player bar (shuffle, previous, play/pause, next, repeat,
 seek, volume, full screen) and "now playing" with the video or the album
 picture. Plays through Qt Multimedia (FFmpeg); tags and cover pictures
 are read with mutagen. The desktop's media controls see and control what
 plays (MPRIS through Gio).
